          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "8"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.782,
            0.104,
            0.899,
            0.121
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "MATHEMATICS"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.139,
            0.628,
            0.157
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Therefore, a and b have at least 3 as a common factor."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.165,
            0.615,
            0.184
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "But this contradicts the fact that a and b are coprime."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.196,
            0.899,
            0.244
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "This contradiction has arisen because of our incorrect assumption that "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\sqrt { 3 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is rational. So, we conclude that "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\sqrt { 3 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is irrational."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.252,
            0.462,
            0.271
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "In Class IX, we mentioned that :"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.285,
            0.897,
            0.305
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "the sum or difference of a rational and an irrational number is irrational and"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.319,
            0.901,
            0.356
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "the product and quotient of a non-zero rational and irrational number is irrational."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.365,
            0.532,
            0.384
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We prove some particular cases here."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.395,
            0.528,
            0.416
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example 6 :",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Show that "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5 - { \\sqrt { 3 } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is irrational."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.427,
            0.728,
            0.447
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Solution :",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Let us assume, to the contrary, that "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5 \\sim \\sqrt { 3 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is rational."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.461,
            0.742,
            0.497
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "That is, we can find coprime a and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "b ( \\underline { b } \\neq 0 )"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " such that "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\sqrt{3} = \\frac{a}{b}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.495,
            0.328,
            0.531
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Therefore, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5 - { \\frac { a } { b } } = { \\sqrt { 3 } }"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.531,
            0.638,
            0.569
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Rearranging this equation, we get "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\sqrt{3}=5-\\frac{a}{b}=\\frac{5b-a}{b}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.572,
            0.814,
            0.606
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Since a and b are integers, we get "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5 - \\frac{a}{b}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is rational, and so "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\sqrt { 3 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is rational."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.607,
            0.57,
            0.626
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "But this contradicts the fact that "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\sqrt { 3 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is irrational."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.634,
            0.9,
            0.679
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "This contradiction has arisen because of our incorrect assumption that "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5 - \\sqrt { 3 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is rational."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.697,
            0.498,
            0.717
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "So, we conclude that "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5 \\geq \\sqrt { 3 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is irrational."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.738,
            0.504,
            0.758
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example 7 :",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Show that "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "3 \\sqrt { 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is irrational."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.766,
            0.704,
            0.786
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Solution :",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Let us assume, to the contrary, that "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "3 \\sqrt { 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is rational."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.797,
            0.718,
            0.832
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "That is, we can find coprime a and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "b \\; ( b \\neq 0 )"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " such that "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "3 { \\sqrt { 2 } } = { \\frac { a } { b } } \\cdot"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.435,
            0.967,
            0.563,
            0.982
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Reprint 2026-27"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.831,
            0.397,
            0.866
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Rearranging, we get "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "{ \\sqrt { 2 } } = { \\frac { a } { 3 b } }"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.869,
            0.739,
            0.905
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Since 3, a and b are integers, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { a } { 3 b }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is rational, and so "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\sqrt { 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is rational."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
